========================================================================
RUNTIME DEPENDENCIES UNDER COPYLEFT OR WEAK-COPYLEFT LICENSES
========================================================================
These packages are declared dependencies. They are used as unmodified,
separately-installed libraries via their public Python APIs; no source from any
of them is vendored into or modified by this repository. They are listed here for
disclosure, since their licenses differ from this project's Apache-2.0.

  pygame    LGPL             declared by holosoma
  pynput    LGPLv3           declared by holosoma, holosoma-inference
  easydict  LGPL-3.0         declared by holosoma
  libigl    MPL-2.0          declared by holosoma-retargeting
  tqdm      MPL-2.0 AND MIT  declared by holosoma, holosoma-retargeting

The corresponding source for each is available from its upstream project and
from PyPI.

========================================================================
PROPRIETARY RUNTIME REQUIREMENTS (NOT REDISTRIBUTED)
========================================================================
Some simulator backends require proprietary software that this repository does
not redistribute. The setup scripts fetch it from the vendor at install time,
under the vendor's own terms:

  Isaac Sim (pip package `isaacsim`)  NVIDIA Proprietary Software.
      Installed from https://pypi.nvidia.com by scripts/setup_isaacsim.sh.
  Isaac Gym (preview release)         NVIDIA proprietary, EULA-gated.
      Downloaded from developer.nvidia.com by scripts/setup_isaacgym.sh.

Neither is required to use this repository's MuJoCo backend.

